##Web Security Essentials — TryHackMe

I Completed the TryHackMe Web Security Essentials room, where I explored the foundations of web application security, common attack 
surfaces, and modern defensive technologies used to secure web environments.

##Overview

This room introduced the core concepts of how web applications function and why they are prime targets for attackers.
I learned how web requests and servers communicate, how attackers exploit vulnerabilities, and how defenders use layered security 
controls to protect applications and users.

