##Key Takeaways

  -Web applications are major attack targets because they often store sensitive data and connect to internal systems.
  -CDNs improve both performance and security by caching content and masking origin servers.
  -WAFs help detect and block malicious HTTP requests before they reach the application.
  -Effective cybersecurity relies on multiple layers of defense working together.

